## OpenSpec + Speckit

Read the shared protocol before creating or implementing governed features:

- `{agent_root / "protocols" / "openspec-speckit-workflow.md"}`
- `{agent_root / "protocols" / "project-agent-bootstrap.md"}`

Core rule:

- OpenSpec is the change-governance layer.
- Speckit is the implementation layer.
- Use OpenSpec before implementation when the work changes product,
